  "Software Details": "Yazılım Detayları",
  "EcommerceGo SaaS introduces a versatile PDF Voucher Module designed to streamline the distribution of coupon codes. This feature empowers merchants to manage and distribute promotional coupons efficiently, enhancing their marketing efforts and customer engagement. By leveraging this module, businesses can boost sales and attract new customers with minimal effort.": "EcommerceGo SaaS, kupon kodlarının dağıtımını kolaylaştırmak için tasarlanmış çok yönlü bir PDF Kupon Modülü sunar. ",
  "View Live Demo": "Canlı Demoyu Görüntüle",
  "User-Friendly Coupon Request Process": "Kullanıcı Dostu Kupon Talep Süreci",
  "The PDF Voucher Module simplifies the process for users to request coupon codes. Customers can easily submit a query for a coupon code directly through the EcommerceGo platform. This intuitive process ensures that customers can take advantage of promotional offers without any hassle, fostering a positive shopping experience and encouraging repeat business.": "PDF Kupon Modülü, kullanıcıların kupon kodu talep etme sürecini basitleştirir. ",
  "Admin Control and Approval": "Yönetici Kontrolü ve Onayı",
  "Upon receiving a coupon code request, the module notifies the admin, who can then review and approve the request. EcommerceGo SaaS provides a streamlined interface for admins to manage these requests efficiently. Once approved, the system automatically generates a PDF containing the coupon codes. This automated process minimizes the administrative burden, allowing businesses to focus on other critical aspects of their operations.": "Bir kupon kodu talebi alındığında modül, yöneticiye bilgi verir ve yönetici daha sonra isteği inceleyip onaylayabilir. ",
  "Automated PDF Generation and Distribution": "Otomatik PDF Oluşturma ve Dağıtımı",
  "After the admin approves a coupon request, the PDF Voucher Module takes over, generating a professional-looking PDF document with the requested coupon codes. This document is then sent directly to the user’s email. The automation of this process ensures that customers receive their coupon codes promptly, enhancing their satisfaction and encouraging them to make a purchase. The professional format of the PDF also reflects positively on the business, reinforcing its credibility.": "Yönetici bir kupon talebini onayladıktan sonra, PDF Kupon Modülü devreye girerek istenen kupon kodlarını içeren profesyonel görünümlü bir PDF belgesi oluşturur. ",
  "Enhancing Marketing and Customer Engagement": "Pazarlama ve Müşteri Etkileşimini Geliştirme",
  "The PDF Voucher Module is a powerful tool for boosting marketing campaigns and customer engagement. By providing an efficient way to distribute coupon codes, businesses can attract more customers and incentivize purchases. The ability to manage coupon requests and distribution seamlessly allows merchants to run promotions effectively, driving sales and fostering customer loyalty. This module not only simplifies the process but also opens new avenues for creative marketing strategies, helping businesses to grow and succeed in the competitive e-commerce environment.": "PDF Kupon Modülü, pazarlama kampanyalarını ve müşteri katılımını artırmak için güçlü bir araçtır. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Neden özel modüller seçmelisiniz?",
